# 🌤️ A fully managed connector example from the playground run menu
Output docs/videos/ccloud-run-menu.mp4
Source tapes/settings.tape
Set Width 1400
Set Height 820
Source tapes/prelude.tape

Type "playground run"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type@120ms "fully"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type@120ms "datagen"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 4s
Down@600ms 10
Sleep 4s
# quit without running anything: nothing is created in Confluent Cloud
Escape
Sleep 2s
